Sources
-------
- 33333s/u60pro-devui (MIT): https://github.com/33333s/u60pro-devui
- Later changes by Wei REN: LVGL rewrite, then the Rust + LVGL rewrite in rs/
  (the current program), screen owner (now luyaz-sentinel in the manager),
  eSIM switching page, Tailscale card, device scripts.

This directory starts from a cleaned snapshot of that work, not from its git
history. Not published:
- third_party/lvgl/ (rs/setup-src.sh fetches LVGL v9.5.0 and applies patches/)
- ubus_list.txt (runtime dump of a real device)
- scripts/remote-build.sh (tied to a private build machine)
- CHANGELOG.md and development notes of older renderers
Private host names in comments and docs were replaced with placeholders.

Third-party components
----------------------
- Build-time dependencies, not included: LVGL v9.5.0 (MIT, with the small
  patch in patches/), FreeType 2.13.3 (FreeType License or GPLv2), and the
  Rust crates listed in the manager's Cargo.lock. A statically linked binary
  carries their code; ship their license texts with any binary you distribute.
- Fonts generated by scripts/fonts/ (Nunito, Resource Han Rounded subset) are
  under the SIL Open Font License and are not included in this repository.
- No ZTE fonts or vendor binaries are included. docs/images/ are rendered by
  the offscreen render test from made-up test data.

